WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.349
An AI agent is told: pay this invoice.

2
00:00:02.349 --> 00:00:06.305
In a UCP checkout, paying is easy. Proving what was paid is not.

3
00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:09.829
Was the invoice really registered with the tax authority?

4
00:00:09.829 --> 00:00:13.291
Was that registration still active when the money moved?

5
00:00:13.291 --> 00:00:15.763
And did the business sign this checkout?

6
00:00:15.763 --> 00:00:17.484
It ships as a Python package.

7
00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:23.477
Install it, load the checkout, the order, the evidence bundle and your trusted keys, and call verify.

8
00:00:23.477 --> 00:00:28.818
Your integration supplies the evidence and trusted keys. The verifier checks them offline.

9
00:00:28.818 --> 00:00:34.515
On the complete synthetic case, all three questions come back established, each with its reason.

10
00:00:34.515 --> 00:00:38.867
Now the real thing: the tax authority's own published, signed sample.

11
00:00:38.867 --> 00:00:42.588
The verifier confirms the registration matches the invoice.

12
00:00:42.588 --> 00:00:48.201
But the sample carries no payment evidence, so was it active at payment? Not established.

13
00:00:48.201 --> 00:00:51.733
The verifier says what the evidence proves, and no more.

14
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:54.792
And when the evidence turns, so does the verdict.

15
00:00:54.792 --> 00:01:01.595
In a separate synthetic test, the signed status says the registration was cancelled before the payment event.

16
00:01:01.595 --> 00:01:06.277
Active at payment: contradicted, with the cancellation named as the reason.

17
00:01:06.277 --> 00:01:10.834
Three verdicts, three values: established, not established, contradicted.

18
00:01:10.834 --> 00:01:14.065
Read the specification, and run the verifier yourself.

19
00:01:14.065 --> 00:01:17.955
The repository is public, and the schema is live on GitHub Pages.

20
00:01:17.955 --> 00:01:22.324
The demo uses simulated registration status and payment capture evidence.

21
00:01:22.324 --> 00:01:25.197
Live integrations supply authenticated evidence.
